OL,3,GNEWSAThe heavy-footed herd helping
OL,4,Aconservation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the season's first snow cloaks the
OL,7,FLake District fells, there is one
OL,8,Fparticular herd of cows thriving in the
OL,9,Ffrosty weather.
OL,11,FThe herd of 53 "hardy" Scottish-bred
OL,12,FBelted Galloways and Luings have roamed
OL,13,FRSPB's Wild Haweswater for some years,
OL,14,Femulating the wild herbivores before
OL,15,Fthe bronze age, as part of a
OL,16,Fconservation grazing project.
OL,18,FThe large, heavy-footed animals trample
OL,19,Fdenser, more dominant vegetation
OL,20,Fallowing delicate plants and young
OL,21,Ftrees to grow, its site manager Glen
OL,22,FSwainson said.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
