OL,3,GNEWSAThe heavy-footed herd helping
OL,4,Aconservation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe growth of trees is increasingly
OL,7,Fimportant for the area, with them
OL,8,Fslowing down the flow of water to help
OL,9,Freduce flood and drought risk and
OL,10,Fproviding valuable shelter to
OL,11,FSwindale's livestock.
